{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850780876140183553","content":"(btw, this is helping me a lot know what I need to focus on in conversations with them, casue its likely I will be the one to talk to them)","created_at":"2021-07-30T15:08:58.019000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870684402202603591","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"850780876140183553","content":"There are other servers that are out there for that kinda role play and this one is not one of them. This is a pg13 server and what they are doing is steppingover that. TAO and I set out with our characters relationship with consent before hand. I reached out to him before anything happened because I felt with how our stories were going it could lead to that. We have made sure to play our relationship in a way so others can see that players can have a tasteful pg13 relationship without the need of crossing that line and to be able to still have fun with it.","created_at":"2021-07-30T15:14:13.737000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T15:14:45.530000Z","id":"870685726419873812","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
