{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850780876140183553","content":"in same vein but re: an unrequited love story — and with a player who places a hard line on romantic interaction.\n\nSpeaker's player and I have known each other for years, there's a trust behind our roleplay, and he talked to me about it many times out of character. plot's taking us down a wildly different path than what we planned when the game started but either way, we still regularly check each other up on what we plan to do in relation to our characters' interactions with each other.","created_at":"2021-07-30T15:16:54.094000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T15:18:10.184000Z","id":"870686399005884426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
